    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d188">

                <pb facs="0334" n="246" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg246"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr.
                            Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-11-26"><hi rendition="#italic">November 26, 1892</hi></date>.
                        (Received December 6.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 846.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my dispatch numbered 841, of
                    the 21st instant, I have the honor to inclose herewith a copy of a note which I
                    have received from the Earl of Rosebery, in reply to the communication which I
                    addressed to his lordship on the 21st ultimo, relative to the conduct of Capt.
                    Davis, of H. M. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Royalist</hi>, to our commercial
                    agent at Butaritari, Gilbert Islands.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry White.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d188-a1.xml" xpointer="d188-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
